Janaka orders ministers to fetch divine bow --- Ministers haul bow chest with five thousand men --- Janaka tells Viśvāmitra no god or king could string bow --- Rāma opens chest and seizes bow in play --- Rāma strings and breaks bow in middle --- Thunder crashes and quake fells onlookers senseless --- Janaka hails Rāma and pledges Sītā as valor prize --- Janaka sends ministers to Ayōdhyā to fetch Daśaratha